Third-party data
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This product embeds a knowledge base derived in part from the following
third-party sources.

1. Kubernetes API lifecycle metadata

   internal/kb/data/apilifecycle.json is generated by tools/gen-kb from the
   generated APILifecycle* methods of k8s.io/api
   (https://github.com/kubernetes/api).
   Copyright The Kubernetes Authors.
   Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

   internal/kb/data/supplement.json and the version-skew policy in
   internal/kb/skew.go record facts published in the Kubernetes
   documentation (https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/deprecation-guide/
   and https://kubernetes.io/releases/version-skew-policy/).
   Copyright The Kubernetes Authors.
   Kubernetes documentation is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

2. endoflife.date

   For registry entries that declare `endoflife_product`, the
   support.status and support.eol_date fields in registry/data/*.yaml are
   synced by tools/eol-sync from the endoflife.date API
