Third-party software
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

upgradescope binaries statically link third-party Go modules (listed in
go.mod). Binaries built with the dashboard also embed a bundled JavaScript
application whose dependencies are listed in web/package-lock.json. Each of
these components remains under its own license.
